-2013:p1398:b004:l036","ordinal":183007,"en":"Enough fox, I hear"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1398:b004:l037","ordinal":183008,"en":"A trouble maker for Beijing"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1398:b004:l038","ordinal":183009,"en":"He says the black eye of time."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1398:b004:l039","ordinal":183010,"en":"If I ask,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l001","ordinal":183011,"en":"“This Kuutülkü standing here"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l002","ordinal":183012,"en":"Is the watchman himself, they say!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l003","ordinal":183013,"en":"If we catch and do away with his fox,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l004","ordinal":183014,"en":"It means God has granted him to us;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l005","ordinal":183015,"en":"But if that bastard Kuutülkü"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l006","ordinal":183016,"en":"Escapes onto the open plain,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l007","ordinal":183017,"en":"It means God has struck us down!"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l008","ordinal":183018,"en":"Here beside me is Kumayyk,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l009","ordinal":183019,"en":"My beloved creature,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l010","ordinal":183020,"en":"Encountered through the unseen,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l011","ordinal":183021,"en":"Found by the favor of God."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l012","ordinal":183022,"en":"When Bakai led the way,"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l013","ordinal":183023,"en":"In the desert of Median"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l014","ordinal":183024,"en":"A blue vulture bore him and left him."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l015","ordinal":183025,"en":"They raised Kumayyk and made him a hound;"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l016","ordinal":183026,"en":"God Most High ordained it"},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l017","ordinal":183027,"en":"And brought him to the Bloodthirsty One."},{"id":"semetey-1-2013:p1399:b003:l018","ordinal":1830